title: RIP phase-4 proof — a target that accepts and never answers
description: oha against the proof's hung service. Every request runs into the request timeout, so the load has requests but no answer; it must not meet its thresholds and the run must not end completed.

tags[2]: proof, performance
kind: performance
target:
  system: checkout-hung
  technology: http
  environment: demo

load:
  tool: oha
  script: http://127.0.0.1:44381/
  vus: 2
  duration_s: 2

method[1]:
  - name: hold-briefly
    activity_type: action
    provider:
      type: process
      path: sh
      arguments[2]: "-c", "sleep 1"
      timeout_s: 5.0

rollbacks[0]:
